    <bpmn:process id="W_W2768" name="W2768. Withholding Tax Reconciliation, 2307 Discrepancy &amp; Vendor Dispute Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor dispute or monthly reconciliation variance
Frequency: Monthly + event-driven
Volume: ~50–100 disputes/year
Owner: Tax Accountant
Participants: Tax Accountant, AP, Vendor, Tax Manager
Source: workflow W2768 — Withholding Tax Reconciliation, 2307 Discrepancy &amp; Vendor Dispute Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
