        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Tax Accountant reconciles total 2307 issued to total EWT booked in GL monthly; investigates variances; identifies duplicate/missed withholdings
Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2768_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2768_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2768_Task7" name="AP responds to vendor disputes over 2307 amount/tax-base/ATC; provides payment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AP responds to vendor disputes over 2307 amount/tax-base/ATC; provides payment evidence and reissues corrected 2307 where warranted
Responsible (R): AP / Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): AP Manager
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2768_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2768_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2768_Task8" name="Tax Manager approves any amended 2307 and corresponding SWD (Sworn Statement of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Tax Manager approves any amended 2307 and corresponding SWD (Sworn Statement of Deduction); tracks corrections for annual 1604E alignment
Responsible (R): Tax Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2768_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2768_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
